7	 * of the wallet and how much goes to the card. It is shared by the client wizards
8	 * (DeployWizard, ResizePicker, AddStorage) and the server actions (payAndDeploy,
9	 * resizeServer, expandDisk) and by renewals (worker/billing.ts), precisely so the
10	 * split a customer SEES is the split that gets CHARGED — the invariant the
11	 * $8.99/$6.29 incident broke elsewhere.
