13	 * The three properties that matter, because breaking any of them either loses
14	 * money or hands Stripe a charge it will reject:
15	 *   1. walletApplied + cardCents === dueCents, always, exactly (integer cents).
16	 *   2. cardCents is 0 or >= Stripe's 50c floor (see the caveat test at the end).
